WEBVTT

00:02:25.808 --> 00:02:30.563
and he was surrounded by family
and friends and two hospice workers.

00:02:31.272 --> 00:02:36.611
He left this world not 20 feet
from where he’d come into it.

00:02:36.944 --> 00:02:40.489
He was born and he died
in the same house.

00:02:41.157 --> 00:02:44.744
I like to think he died
as well as he'd lived.

00:02:44.785 --> 00:02:46.704
On his own terms.

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:50.124
I had the honor of giving the eulogy,

00:02:50.166 --> 00:02:54.337
and ultimately he'd chosen
cremation over that "casket."

00:02:55.046 --> 00:02:57.840
As I looked over at my dad's ashes,

00:02:57.882 --> 00:03:02.220
I had to smile because, you know,
our dad really loved beer.